## ESP-IDF C style rules (mandatory)

| Rule | Required value |
|------|----------------|
| Indent | 4 spaces, no tabs |
| Function brace | Own line for definitions |
| `if`/`for`/`while` brace | Same line as keyword |
| Static variable prefix | `s_` |
| Module prefix | `board_` for public symbols |
| Max line length | 120 characters |
| Error return | `esp_err_t` + `ESP_RETURN_ON_ERROR` |
| Doc comment style | `/** */` with `@brief` / `@note` / `@return` |
| Inline comment | `//` |
| Line endings | LF only |
